WEBVTT

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.450
Hana! What's wrong?!

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:14.220
Did he do something to you?

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.160
No, actually, I just—

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:17.080
No, don't say it!

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.750
You again?

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:19.950
No, it's not like that...

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.360
Enough! That's all the work for today!

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:23.080
Return to the prison!

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:25.920
Nicely done, Kiyoshi-dono!

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:27.940
Making that despot Hana cry as you did!

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:29.330
No, a crow just suddenly—

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:32.630
Kiyoshi! When you step
up, you really step up!

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:35.010
I'm just glad I got through it without getting killed.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.340
All right, let's hoist him up!

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:36.840
Sto—!

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.600
I promised Chiyo-chan that

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.300
I would go on our date
to the sumo matches.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:42.730
What do I do?!

00:02:14.390 --> 00:02:17.650
I hear the boys are in that prison...

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:18.870
aren't they?

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:23.080
Don't you think that punishment...

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:24.620
is a little too harsh?

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:26.310
They were caught

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:29.150
doing something they would
normally be expelled for.

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:30.000
They deserve it.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.210
Besides, going coed was something that I—

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:35.840
No, make that the majority of students, the alumni,

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:38.880
not to mention the current
educators, were <i>all</i> opposed to.

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.970
I understand the desire
to preserve tradition,

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:44.640
but changes are also necessary from time to time...

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:46.100
don't you think?

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:48.800
Chairman, you ignored
everyone's objections,

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:52.400
unilaterally allowed those five boys to enroll here,

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:54.900
and this problematic
behavior was the result.

00:02:54.900 --> 00:03:00.140
Well, that's something any boy their age would try...

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:00.740
right?

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:01.910
Peeping is a criminal offense!

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:03.600
I know.

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:06.870
I have no intention of
justifying their actions.

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:10.040
But I want you to at least give them Saturdays and Sundays off.

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:12.330
Those are the prison rules...

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:13.880
aren't they?

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:17.030
I am aware of that, Father.

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:23.180
Starting today, your after-school work detail will be to clear this wasteland.

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:28.930
I didn't say a word! What was that for?!

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:31.390
Ask me why you're clearing it.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:32.870
That was unwarranted...

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:34.660
As the question has arisen,

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:38.020
the reason you will clear this land is
to create a campus vegetable garden!

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:40.400
Um, may I ask a question?

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:41.460
Permission granted.

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:44.320
Do we get Saturdays and Sundays off?

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:47.750
On Saturdays and Sundays, when you have no classes, the work goes on, right?

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:49.400
You'll work, of course.

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:51.790
However...

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.250
prisoners who exhibit good behavior

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:56.010
will be allowed three hours of weekend free time,

00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:57.490
including furloughs.

00:03:57.490 --> 00:03:58.250
President!

00:03:58.570 --> 00:03:59.630
Freedom!

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:01.610
All right! This will work!

00:04:01.610 --> 00:04:04.550
My date to the sumo matches with Chiyo-chan is next Saturday!

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:07.120
All right! Guys, let's do it!

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:09.590
We will be model high school prisoners!

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:12.350
We're getting the weekend off, no matter what!

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:16.610
It's the student council president!

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:17.550
The vice president, too!

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:18.440
They're so cool!

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:19.650
President!

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:21.360
This year's

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:24.180
"Underground Student Council Official Guide Book" has just arrived.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:25.990
Now Hana-san is here, too!

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:26.930
She's so cute!

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:29.750
The Underground Student
Council sure is popular, huh?

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.780
Enough so that they have their own guide book—

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:33.610
Ow!

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:35.120
What did you do that for, Joe?!

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.100
You...

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.000
You almost stepped on some ants.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.000
Ants?

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:45.850
Joe-kun, you really like ants.

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:47.810
You there! No slacking off!

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:48.760
Sorry!

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:54.860
Chairman, this year's guide book...

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:07.450
<i>This</i> is why all men are scum.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:08.780
Break time!

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:12.370
Break time? Does that mean we still have to work?

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:15.710
It's tough, but if I work hard to be a model prisoner,

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.790
I can go on my date with Chiyo-chan!

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.530
Why are they having a break?

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:22.710
They aren't making any progress, are they?

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:23.930
At this rate...

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:26.800
we'll have to make them work over the weekend, too.

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:30.510
President! That's not fai—!

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:32.850
I won't be able to go on my date!

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:35.150
What do I do? Sick family member?

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:36.710
No, they'll find out right away.

00:05:36.710 --> 00:05:39.490
A stomach ache? There's no way they'll fall for that.

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:41.690
What do I do, Chiyo-chan?

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:55.200
I have to break out!

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:01.310
On the gate!

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:05.260
Roll call!

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:05.770
One!

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:06.310
Two!

00:06:06.310 --> 00:06:06.860
Three!

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:07.270
Four!

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:07.720
Five!

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:18.560
Vice President!

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:21.770
The trash is building up, may I go dispose of it?

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:22.860
Permission granted.

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:41.000
At this rate,

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:44.000
it will be big enough for me to get through on the day of our date.

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:48.220
Three minutes is the
limit for each turn here.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:55.810
Chiyo-chan?

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.320
What is she trying to do?

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:08.380
Kiyoshi-kun, the line for the Student Sumo Tournament

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:11.320
forms at 13:00 at the Ryogoku Gymnasium entrance.

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:12.780
You can get sprung
on Saturday, can't you?

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:16.290
"Thank you very much."

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:17.950
"No, thank you<i>."</i>

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:20.710
The truth is, now that
I won't get a furlough,

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:23.130
I've got no choice but to break out.

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:24.980
Well, something will turn up!

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:28.900
What do you mean by forgetting to load the trash onto the cart?

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:30.300
My apologies!

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:33.020
Yikes! I missed a pile!

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:34.930
Now Gakuto's taking the blame for it!

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:38.260
I'm sorry! I'll dispose of it at once!

00:07:38.260 --> 00:07:39.770
Kiyoshi-dono!

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:41.390
No, <i>you</i> go!

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:50.130
Gakuto, sorry about earlier.

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:52.070
You got yelled at because of me...

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:54.090
Gakuto?

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:55.280
Are you okay?

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:56.300
Huh?

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:59.950
Yes... I am splendid.
I've grown inured to it.

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:02.170
It was my fault, take one of my Karaage.

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:04.100
Oh, much obliged.

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:10.550
Kiyoshi-dono, would you
fancy some more tea?

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:12.140
Sure, thanks.

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:16.390
You know, Kiyoshi-dono,

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:19.020
this was lying near the trash site.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:27.690
He knows.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.150
He definitely knows.

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:32.620
What the hell is Gakuto planning to do?

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:35.540
Can I offer to wash your back for you?

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:37.280
Kiyoshi-dono,

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:41.160
from what I hear, yokozuna have assistants

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:45.670
wash their backs for them, as well as their <i>posteriors</i>.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:50.250
No! I'm not a yokozuna, so I'll pass.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:56.080
As of today, Hana will
return as your overseer.

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:57.220
Nice working with you!

00:08:58.220 --> 00:08:59.070
This sucks.

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:01.720
What are you whispering about?!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.140
Commence laboring!

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:07.980
Yes!

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:12.500
Gakuto isn't going to squeal to the Underground Student Council about me breaking out.

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:15.060
As I remember, if they find out about it,

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:16.920
everyone's sentence will be extended by a month—

00:09:16.920 --> 00:09:17.910
All right!

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:20.080
I shall do my absolute best today!

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:25.870
No sumo stomping without permission!

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:28.000
What the hell is he doing?

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.060
All of these sumo-themed antics!

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:31.460
Is he enjoying himself by harassing me?

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:33.410
If it comes down to it, I'll take him and...

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:35.630
Hey, where are you?

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:38.660
Sorry, I was arranging some garbage in the back.

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:41.010
What is it?

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:43.390
You told the other boys, didn't you?

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:43.990
Huh?

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:46.100
About what happened.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.510
About what happened?

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:49.560
Me pee—

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:50.100
Huh?

00:09:52.140 --> 00:09:53.280
About me peeing!

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:55.530
You told everyone,
and made fun of me!

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.150
I didn't do anything like that.

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:59.010
Liar! I don't believe you!

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:00.450
It's the truth.

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:03.490
Then, you do it, too.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:05.200
Huh? Do what?

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:08.670
Pee for me, right here! In front of my eyes!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.540
Do that, and I'll believe you!

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.420
No way, I can't do that!

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:15.120
You saw me do it, so
let me see <i>you</i> do it!

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:16.630
Otherwise, it's not fair, is it?!

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:20.400
If you don't, then I'll kill you, and then take my own life!

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:21.350
A-All right!

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:24.790
Y-You really want me to do this?

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:26.350
Of course I do.

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:29.590
What are you doing?

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:32.520
Do it turned towards me.

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:33.610
Huh?!

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:39.820
Whoa! Aren't you a little close?

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:42.090
You were even closer, weren't you?

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:43.450
Now hurry and start going.

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:55.260
Kiyoshi-dono! Kiyoshi-dono!

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:56.340
Gakuto, what's up?

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:59.470
You missed a pile of trash again.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:00.220
Tch.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:02.020
Oh, sorry.

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:04.910
Once you finish disposing of it, return to work immediately.

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:05.810
Yes!

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:08.810
You saved me, Gakuto.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:09.980
Thanks.

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:14.910
Gakuto did<i> just save me, right?</i>

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:15.980
What's going on here?

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:19.410
He's not planning to rat me out?

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:21.410
Oh, no!

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.610
He's heading toward
the hole I'm digging!

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:24.410
Gakuto!

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:27.370
Damn it! He's going
to see definitive proof!

00:11:27.610 --> 00:11:30.120
At this point, I have no choice but to...

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:32.080
If you are planning...

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:34.030
to break out...

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:37.000
it would have to be hither,
where you are unaccompanied.

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:40.260
I want you to break out.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:40.930
Huh?

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:44.750
Yours truly shall assist you with your breakout, Kiyoshi-dono.

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:47.430
You'll... help me break out?

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:48.810
Correct.

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:52.560
<i>You</i>, who's been threatening me
with sumo-themed antics all day?

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:55.570
I was signaling you that yours
truly would abet your escape!

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:58.440
How was I supposed to know?!
And why are you helping me, anyway?!

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:01.490
The day of the Student Sumo Tournament in two weeks...

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:05.200
That is a momentous day for yours truly, as well.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.730
Specifics forthcoming this evening.

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:16.250
President, I'll wash your back for you.

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:17.480
Thank you.

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:19.460
Please do, Vice President.

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:22.820
Incidentally, I understand that yokozuna

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:26.760
have attendants wash their
backs, and their <i>posteriors</i>.

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:28.510
Vice President...

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:31.030
Have I put on <i>that</i> much weight?

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.480
To yokozuna-grade?

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.590
No! I did not mean it that way!

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:35.650
Please excuse me!

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:39.530
I apologize for having you oversee the boys through the weekend.

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:40.970
Don't be absurd.

00:12:40.970 --> 00:12:43.740
However, are you sure about
disobeying the chairman's orders,

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:47.240
by making the prisoners work on their days off?

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:51.070
It is only model prisoners that are given free time on the weekends.

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:52.620
Since they are behind
on their prison labors,

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:55.230
there is no way they can be
considered model prisoners.

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:56.630
You are absolutely correct.

00:12:56.630 --> 00:13:02.090
When I think about how those peeping toms could be released into the wild within half a month,

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.350
I become <i>deeply</i> concerned.

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:10.140
Mari must have seen this.

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:14.440
Could this be the reason she took the boys' free time from them?

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:16.230
I just have to say...

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:17.440
Women!

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:18.440
Just in case,

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.930
I'd better take this home...

00:13:20.930 --> 00:13:21.530
with me.

00:13:22.220 --> 00:13:24.400
I'd like to see some
commercial TV for once.

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:27.300
Yours truly does not have a craven motive

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:30.200
such as a date to a sumo match.

00:13:30.980 --> 00:13:33.680
Kiyoshi-dono, have you heard of
"The Romance of the Three Kingdoms"?

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:35.830
Well, I know the name, at least.

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:39.070
The time is the Late Han Dynasty, at the end of the 2nd century.

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:40.790
The might of the emperor descends beneath the soil,

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:44.220
and the eunuchs known as the
Ten Attendants seize power—

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:44.920
Get to the point!

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:47.720
What I'm saying is that after an eternity,

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:52.350
a once-every-four-years Three Kingdoms figurine fair is being held in Akihabara!

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:55.570
Yours truly must go there to procure limited edition

00:13:55.570 --> 00:13:58.230
Guan Yu and Red Hare figurines!

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:00.310
That's <i>your</i> craven motive?

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:03.690
What do you mean, craven?!
It's a once-every-four-years limited edition!

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:06.900
And that's why you want
to break out with me?

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:10.060
Kiyoshi-dono, you really are a buffoon.

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:10.820
During work—

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:12.420
What are you guys up to?

00:14:12.420 --> 00:14:13.820
Playing gomoku.

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:14.740
You wanna go next?

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:17.160
Man, how dull. Count me out.

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:20.850
Kiyoshi-dono, it's a one-hour trip one-way from this prison

00:14:20.850 --> 00:14:23.160
to Ryogoku Gymnasium,
where your sumo date will be.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:27.880
Positing that watching the matches takes one hour, that's a total of three hours.

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:31.410
Kiyoshi-dono, if you go missing for three hours during work,

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:33.550
you are certain to be found out.

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:34.180
True enough.

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:37.300
In other words, it is categorically
impossible for you to break out alone.

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:40.060
That is why I said I would abet you.

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:43.800
Saturday afternoon, during the three hours
when you will break out and go on your date,

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:45.940
as well as buy yours truly's Three Kingdoms figurine,

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:49.100
yours truly will distract the overseers' gaze!

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:51.570
Distract them? But how?

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:55.240
Hmph, I have a stratagem.

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:57.160
I-Is that...?

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:59.670
A map of the school made to look like a gomoku game?!

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:11.390
Patrolling the school building, are we?

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:13.520
Are you going home?

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:14.220
Be careful—

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:23.910
Starting tomorrow,

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:27.570
the boys will be treated even more harshly.

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:30.350
Their crimes are bad
enough, but I will ensure

00:15:30.350 --> 00:15:33.720
they won't become the deplorable kind of person that you are.

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:35.580
You don't...

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:36.330
say!

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:44.820
Kiyoshi-dono, the hole
that you are digging—

00:15:45.390 --> 00:15:47.440
If you can extricate yourself through there,

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:49.540
you can make your escape without anyone noticing.

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:53.250
The problem is, how do I distract the overseers for three hours?

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:56.310
The Underground Student
Council is unlikely to not notice.

00:15:57.460 --> 00:15:59.090
Listen, Gakuto,

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:01.140
from what you're saying,

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:04.090
I'm beginning to think that breaking out is impossible.

00:16:05.570 --> 00:16:07.050
Never you fear!

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:10.770
Yours truly has been called the most resourceful general in Nerima.

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:14.250
I have something up my sleeve
to make the impossible possible!

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:17.810
I'm going to go dispose of this trash.

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:19.730
Permission granted.

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:28.050
Kiyoshi-dono!

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:29.530
What's the matter, Gakuto—

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:33.040
How often will you miss piles before you're satisfied?!

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:34.810
Ah, my bad, my bad.

00:16:34.810 --> 00:16:35.960
I've done it again.

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:38.280
What in blazes are you
saying it like that for?!

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:40.550
You offer me a sincere apology, right now!

00:16:40.550 --> 00:16:42.920
Oh, pipe down.
It doesn't really matter.

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:44.240
It <i>does</i> matter!

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:46.130
Stand still and take your pommeling like a man!

00:16:47.210 --> 00:16:48.800
What are you doing?!

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:50.430
What are you two doing?!

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:00.330
Why, you...

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:00.990
No!

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:02.190
It wasn't us!

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:03.320
It was Hana-san!

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:05.820
They were fighting, and pushed it over.

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:07.150
Eh?! No way!

00:17:07.150 --> 00:17:09.660
Heads or tails, choose one.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:10.330
Huh?

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:11.570
Choose now!

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:13.850
Heads.

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:14.910
Tails.

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:22.130
The president told me to go even harder on you from now on,

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:24.460
so I got this riding crop.

00:17:29.550 --> 00:17:31.720
C-Can't breathe...!

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:37.420
Don't move!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:39.430
Don't make a sound!

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:42.860
Ow! No, don't—!

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:44.800
That looks really bad.

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:45.670
How awful.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:47.270
Yeah.

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:50.870
Tails is awful, all right, but heads gets even more contact.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:53.740
You two are hereby
ordered to repair the shed.

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:55.360
No way!

00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:57.120
Just the two of us?

00:17:57.120 --> 00:17:58.780
Unthinkable!

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:04.080
Kiyoshi-dono...

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:05.430
Gakuto!

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:06.850
Stage one of the plan...

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:08.220
...is an unqualified success.

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:10.890
Cut some notches into
the posts with the saw,

00:18:10.890 --> 00:18:13.840
pretend to fight, and bring down the shed.

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:17.080
Now the two of us can remain by the escape hole, unsupervised.

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:18.430
As expected from you!

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:19.480
What are you two up to?

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:19.980
Eh?!

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:21.330
Don't "Eh" me.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:23.310
Start fixing it, right now.

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:25.860
Um, Hana-san, are you staying here?

00:18:25.860 --> 00:18:28.820
Of course I am. I'm your overseer.

00:18:29.180 --> 00:18:32.260
Hey, Gakuto, with Hana-san staying here now,

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:33.260
what do we do?

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:37.850
I am the famed most resourceful general in Nerima.

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:39.500
Then you <i>do</i> have a plan for this?

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:44.630
Nonetheless, even yours truly did not foresee this development!

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:46.170
Seriously?

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:47.510
What are we going to do?

00:18:47.510 --> 00:18:50.040
What are you two whispering about over there?

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:52.010
Hey, Kiyoshi, come here a minute.

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:54.260
Ugh, just me?

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:55.760
My deepest condolences.

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:57.890
What were you two talking about?

00:18:57.890 --> 00:19:00.360
You weren't telling four-eyes about <i>that</i>, were you?

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:01.940
About <i>that</i>? You mean the peeing?

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:03.770
Shh! Lower your voice!

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:04.720
I'm sorry.

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:05.550
I mean it.

00:19:05.550 --> 00:19:08.650
If you tell anyone,
I'll kill you, then kill myself.

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:10.950
I know! I won't tell anyone!

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:12.820
In that case, make with it, right now.

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:14.700
I don't have to go right now...

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:17.080
Then, I'll make it so
you have to go plenty.

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:19.080
What is that?

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.640
It's just ordinary tea.

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:21.790
Now drink it!

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:25.640
Are you in one piece?!

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:27.280
Have you come up with any ideas?

00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:29.550
If you think coming up
with ideas is that easy!

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:35.800
You'd be right, for yours truly has the brightest mind in Nerima.

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:37.460
Oh! So, what do we do?!

00:19:37.460 --> 00:19:39.970
We are ill-matched for
Hana-dono in strength.

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:41.700
Hence, we attack from the inside.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:42.850
I get it. So...?

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:46.230
I shall take Hana-dono as my wife.

00:19:46.230 --> 00:19:47.480
Huh?

00:19:47.860 --> 00:19:52.490
The quickest way is to make
Hana-dono enthralled by yours truly.

00:19:52.490 --> 00:19:55.290
Sorry, but I don't have any idea what you're saying.

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:56.740
Now, now, just listen.

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:59.820
According to my profiling, a lass who likes clovers,

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:03.010
wears leggings under her skirt,
and wears her hair in straight bangs...

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:05.480
is highly likely to be a history fangirl.

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:09.470
Yours truly, who is well-versed in history, can easily make Hana-dono fall for him.

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:11.260
Let's think up another way.

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:13.430
There is no time.

00:20:13.430 --> 00:20:14.670
I shall get right to it.

00:20:14.670 --> 00:20:16.140
Hold on! You'll get killed!

00:20:16.140 --> 00:20:17.250
Hana-dono!

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:18.100
Hmm?

00:20:18.100 --> 00:20:20.030
Woe, troubled times, troubled times!

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:22.350
This is a tale from the continent,
circa the dawn of the third century!

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:25.480
Zhao Yun, carrying
Lord Liu Bei's son Adou,

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:27.100
outstrips a force of 100,000 to—

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:31.690
Don't go spilling that nonsense to me!

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:35.230
I am stunned by this unexpected turn of events.

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:38.100
<i>I'm</i> stunned by how closely
I predicted what would happen.

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:41.950
All doors are closed to us now!

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:43.620
My dreams are left to die!

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:46.330
It's still too soon to give up, right?

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:47.050
Hmm?

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:49.750
Kiyoshi-dono, why are
you doing a dance step?

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:52.250
Oh, uh, no reason.

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:53.960
By any chance, Kiyoshi-dono...

00:20:54.250 --> 00:20:55.460
This is felicitous.

00:20:55.460 --> 00:20:57.090
Let yours truly handle this.

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:00.940
Kiyoshi-dono requires use of the lavatory!

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:01.930
He requests your permission!

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:02.970
You idiot! Knock it off!

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:06.280
You are such a child, Kiyoshi-dono.

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:08.300
There is naught to be ashamed of.

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:09.680
No, he's wrong!

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:11.360
Gakuto is under the wrong impression!

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:12.480
Permission granted.

00:21:13.260 --> 00:21:15.510
Holding it in is not conducive to your well-being.

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:17.200
Hey, you stay out of it!

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:18.950
I said, permission granted!

00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:20.550
Uh, yes.

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:26.870
Of course, she's coming, too.

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:41.750
Okay, we're good to go.

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:43.020
No, we're not!

00:21:43.020 --> 00:21:44.020
Please leave!

00:21:44.020 --> 00:21:46.690
I'll leave after I see you pee!

00:21:46.690 --> 00:21:48.350
I mean it! Please don't do this!

00:21:48.350 --> 00:21:50.810
You don't know when to quit! Out with it!

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:54.400
I told you, let it out already!

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:56.610
Why, you...

00:21:57.050 --> 00:21:58.950
Just hold still!

00:22:02.870 --> 00:22:04.410
N... N...

00:22:04.830 --> 00:22:05.830
N...

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:08.250
No! Please let me go!

00:22:20.880 --> 00:22:21.840
Hana! What's wrong?!

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:24.760
Vice President...

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:26.020
Is that...?!

00:22:26.900 --> 00:22:29.690
I had a little accident.

00:22:32.610 --> 00:22:35.640
Hana! Pull it together!

00:22:38.060 --> 00:22:41.200
Hana is not feeling well, and is taking the day off.

00:22:41.520 --> 00:22:45.640
Kiyoshi-dono, what manner of strategy did you use?

00:22:45.640 --> 00:22:48.250
Oh, I didn't do anything.

00:22:48.250 --> 00:22:52.750
Whatever the case, now our breakout plan can proceed as planned.

00:22:52.750 --> 00:22:54.840
What are you grinning about?!

00:24:35.340 --> 00:24:37.150
Next time on Prison School:

00:24:37.860 --> 00:24:39.010
"A Mighty Spurt."
